{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/fefc2338cb7f392bf6fb6c674e5285b3.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ordinary November night, a sixteen-year-old boy called Jamie witnesses a paranormal event in his own house. Shortly afterwards, he is transported to Aliorbis, a mysterious alternate version of Earth where magic and science coexist in almost perfect harmony. It\u2019s the place where all the legends that we know of were born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, Jamie learns that he is what is known as a \u201cVisitor\u201d, someone who can cross the barrier that separates his world and Aliorbis. He quickly becomes part of SEEK, an organization that investigates crimes that pose a threat to both worlds. Through his adventures with SEEK, Jamie slowly becomes acquainted with its dark and twisted past filled with corruption and chaos, and gradually begins to wonder if he is truly on the right side of this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/499df693ea64ab45f7f43894ca8d2a6e.poster.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/499df693ea64ab45f7f43894ca8d2a6e.webm?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/499df693ea64ab45f7f43894ca8d2a6e.mp4?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/81ae0660783233783a73016ed1f34334.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nocturnal Visitors: Book One\u00a0</i>boasts a visual style inspired by games of the late 2000s, with graphics straight out of the seventh generation of consoles. It's a\u00a0nostalgic look into the games that  we 2000s kids  grew up with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.poster.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.webm?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.mp4?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/f0718dee8da31924b2595c58d31acb22.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as six different characters with unique storylines and points of views. Each of them hold a piece of the overall puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/598b61e121a7d136ce92c544e59b0029.poster.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/598b61e121a7d136ce92c544e59b0029.webm?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/a93c41a37224cd04918b65fb64112249.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a immersive world with a carefully crafted lore. Investigate different scenarios filled with secrets. Everything is interactable. Everything is a clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c08682a1359b0b754183bf50aee48f5e.poster.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c08682a1359b0b754183bf50aee48f5e.webm?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c08682a1359b0b754183bf50aee48f5e.mp4?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c302602e8a9b165adbfeac33971c63b3.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in different turn-based battles with different characters and which outcome will shape the story. Whether you win or you lose, the story continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/7dc625081ecb4fa8c8bf973c62f10a09.poster.avif?t=1757764855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/7dc625081ecb4fa8c8bf973c62f10a09.webm?t=1757764855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/7dc625081ecb4fa8c8bf973c62f10a09.mp4?t=